## Code group

<CodeGroup labels={['npm', 'pnpm', 'bun']}>
  <Tab>

  Install with `npm install acrolls`.

  </Tab>
  <Tab>

  Install with `pnpm add acrolls`.

  </Tab>
  <Tab>

  Install with `bun add acrolls`.

  </Tab>
</CodeGroup>

## Steps

<Steps>
  <Step title="Install">

  Add the `acrolls` package to your SvelteKit host.

  </Step>
  <Step title="Author">

  Write content in Markdown or `.svx` files.

  </Step>
  <Step title="Ship">

  Build and deploy your documentation site.

  </Step>
</Steps>

